Z||000009||btoth||11-13-2000||09:51 PM||||Yes, security is definatly an issue if you have something to protect.  There are DSL Routers that include built-in programmable firewalls that are pretty secure.  (May be too complicated...)<P>Serv-U FTP is a good program.  And there are many others.  Check out <A HREF="http://www.download.com" TARGET=_blank>www.download.com</A>  .<P>Personally, I've never been too concerned with a 'hacker' breaking into my computer.  They would just be wasting their time.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
